      "description": "<p>This blog is now closed. Read our full report here:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/29/erin-patterson-mushroom-murders-appeal-ruling-ntwnfb\">Erin Patterson loses appeal as harsher sentence imposed</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>Patterson</strong> showed no emotion on the video feed as <strong>McLeish</strong> outlined why her appeal had failed, and how the director of public prosecutions had succeeded in seeking a longer sentence.</p><p><strong>Patterson’s actions mean it is ‘inappropriate’ to fix non-parole period, justice says</strong></p><p>The applicant’s murderous intent dated back to the invitations to lunch, it persisted through the lunch that the poison was administered …</p><p>We have concluded that the case involved such calculated criminality that it is inappropriate to fix a non-parole period.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/oct/30/erin-patterson-appeal-live-updates-australia-mushroom-murders-case-retrial-bid-latest-news-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
